T7 - Clostridium dRNA-seq Data Download Instructions

Step 1: Install the sra toolkit
Here is the link: 
https://github.com/ncbi/sra-tools/wiki/02.-Installing-SRA-Toolkit

Do the following steps in the terminal
Step 2: Verify installation (if need)
Open a terminal (Command Prompt on Windows, Terminal on Mac/Linux)
and type: 
fastq-dump --version

Step 3: Clone the repository
Type: 
git clone https://github.com/HKUST-iGEM-2026/cb-promoter-mining.git
cd cb-promoter-mining/data-acquisition-and-curation/T7

Step 4: Download the data
Type: 
prefetch --option-file SRR_Acc_List.txt
Wait for downloading

Step 5: Convert to FASTQ
Run this command (press Enter after each line):
for srr in $(cat SRR_Acc_List.txt); do
    fastq-dump --split-3 --gzip ${srr}/${srr}.sra --outdir .
done

Step 6: Verify download (if need)
Type: 
ls *.fastq.gz | wc -l
du -sh .
